# Deny by default. This repo is public; nothing enters it by accident.
#
# The bar book lives in the parent directory and must never appear here:
# it names a real person alongside her drink ratings and palate profile,
# and carries retail prices for every bottle in the house. A public GitHub
# repo is browsable file-by-file, so "noindex" would not protect any of it.
#
# data/ (ratings.json, people.json) is more sensitive still — raw personal
# data rather than rendered prose. It is not in this directory at all, and
# that structural separation is the real protection. This file is the second lock.

*

!.gitignore
!index.html
!CNAME
!README.md
